out
*.so
*.pyc
# anchor to repo root: the build generates /.config (from `cp coreone/.config .config`),
# but coreone/.config is the TRACKED canonical coexist build config (like .config-noboot).
/.config
/.config.old
klippy/.version

# local python venv for the firmware packing tooling (coreone/requirements.txt).
# NO trailing slash: in this tree .venv is a SYMLINK to ~/git/pfb-klipper/.venv, and a
# trailing-slash pattern matches directories only — `.venv/` left both the root and the
# coreone/ symlink showing as untracked.
.venv

# H503 build outputs — regenerated by coreone/h5/build-*.sh (not tracked; ship via GitHub Release)
coreone/h5/*.bin
coreone/out/
